{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The engine’s own darkness is a description problem. A dark room prints “It is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pitch black. You can’t see a thing.”, its contents stop being resolvable nouns,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the player is inconvenienced. They can stand there for a hundred turns."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This library supplies the consequence, on the schedule the original used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","isActive":true},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GameContent"},{"text":" bundle with no rooms in it — one namespaced","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"counter, one daemon, two knobs and a text table on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init"},{"type":"text","text":". Wiring is a single line: list the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"instance in the game’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"content"},{"text":" block. It reads ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"player.location.isLit"},{"type":"text","text":", which"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already answers the whole question of whether there is light here from anything,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a host that has declared its dark rooms and a lamp has declared everything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"this needs. The schedule is settled at "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init"},{"type":"text","text":", and so is the prose — with one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"subject passed at the moment it is spoken: the death line is handed the vehicle"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player was aboard, because a sentence about being found has to say where."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The daemon counts consecutive turns ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ending"}]},{"text":" in darkness, wherever they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spent. Lingering is lethal and movement is not, so a lightless dash toward the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stairs can still work. Any reachable light resets the count to zero. Dark turn 1"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints the warning; dark turns 2 through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 1"},{"text":" are a silent grace;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from dark turn ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 2"},{"type":"text","text":" on, every turn rolls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"chance(lethality)"},{"text":" to be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"eaten. The warning turn is always safe, which is the classic fairness contract:"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a player who UNDOes a death gets the warning beat back before the dice can turn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"on them again."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two instances in one game collide on their shared "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Global"},{"type":"text","text":" namespace before the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"timer name matters. One lethal dark per game."}]},{"text":"Wiring","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Wiring"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoDangerousDark","","struct Deeps: Game {","    let title = \"Deeps\"","","    let dark = DangerousDark()   \/\/ stock prose, one turn of grace, 50% a turn","","    var content: GameContents { dark }","","    var map: WorldMap { … }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A game with its own voice for the dark passes its two lines as a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text"},{"text":", the way every library that prints takes its table:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let dark = DangerousDark(graceTurns: 1, lethality: 50, text: Prose.grueText)","","static let grueText: DangerousDark.Text = {","    var text = DangerousDark.Text()","    text.warning = Prose.grueWarning","    text.death = Prose.grueDeath","    return text","}()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"death"},{"text":" takes a subject where ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"warning"},{"text":" does not: the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"vehicle the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"player was aboard"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", or nothing when they were on their own feet. Write both","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"halves with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".naming(orBare:)"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["static let grueDeath = GameText.Line<GameText.Noun?>.naming(","    orBare: \"…the room…\"",") {","    \"…\\($0)…\"","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The death this daemon deals is always the lingering one"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and the line has to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be true of that. The counter cannot reach the dice before the third dark turn, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing it kills was killed on the turn it walked into the dark. Zork draws the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinction with two separate sentences and this is the second of them: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"V-WALK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gverbs.zil:1578"},{"type":"text","text":") says "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“You have walked into the slavering fangs of a lurking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grue!”"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and fires only on a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"blocked"}]},{"type":"text","text":" move in the dark, which is a branch this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"library does not have; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GOTO"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":":2110-2114"},{"type":"text","text":") names the vehicle you are sitting in,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or says “room”. Both halves are the game’s words — the stock line names no place"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at all, because a library that has not seen the game should not decide what to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call the place somebody was taken from."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"warning"},{"type":"text","text":" is said "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"once","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" per turn, through the engine’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sayOnceThisTurn(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A game that also points "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"text.pitchBlack"},{"type":"text","text":" at the same sentence — Zork does,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because there the dark-room line "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"is","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" the threat — reads it a single time on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"turn it walks into the dark, whichever speaker got there first. Two different"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sentences are two different sentences, and both print. A warning swallowed for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"repeating the room’s own line is still a warned turn."}]},{"text":"Making the dark harmless","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Making-the-dark-harmless"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a room whose solution is to stand in the dark on purpose, or a scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"should not be interrupted, set "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["cryptDoor.after(.close) { dark.suspended = true }","cryptDoor.after(.open) { dark.suspended = false }"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Do not stop the daemon by name.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" It is called "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"grue\""},{"type":"text","text":", and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopDaemon(\"grue\")"},{"type":"text","text":" freezes the counter at whatever it had reached, so resuming"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can put the player straight onto a dice turn and cost them the warning."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suspending resets the count on every suspended turn, for exactly that reason, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"draws no randomness while it is set."}]},{"text":"Worked example","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Worked-example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sources\/Zork1\/"},{"type":"text","text":" wires this over the engine’s own light mechanics — the brass"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lantern is a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"lightSource"},{"type":"text","text":" on two fuses, and the grue is what makes the fuses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"matter. The engine’s side of it (the ","type":"text"},{"code":"dark","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" trait, ","type":"text"},{"code":"lightSource","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", what counts as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"light reaching a room, ","type":"text"},{"code":"die(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and the resurrection hook) is the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Time, and Death"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" article in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Gnusto","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" documentation.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Darkness that kills: a warning, a grace period, then dice."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"GnustoDangerousDark","externalID":"GnustoDangerousDark","modules":[{"name":"GnustoDangerousDark"}],"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module"},"topicSections":[{"title":"The content bundle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/init(graceTurns:lethality:text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text"],"anchor":"The-content-bundle"},{"title":"Turning the dark off and on","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/suspended"],"anchor":"Turning-the-dark-off-and-on"},{"title":"The daemon","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoDange